OL,3,GNEWSABiker who died following crash on
OL,4,ALewis named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist who died following a
OL,7,Fcrash on the Isle of Lewis in the
OL,8,FWestern Isles has been named by police.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fcollision between Ronald Crichton's
OL,12,Fblack BMW S1000 RS motorcycle and a
OL,13,Fsilver MG car near Newmarket at about
OL,14,F16:40 on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe 56-year-old, from Mull in Argyll,
OL,17,Fwas taken to Western Isles Hospital in
OL,18,FStornoway where he died.
OL,20,FPolice said the 44-year-old male driver
OL,21,Fof the car was arrested in connection
OL,22,Fwith the crash.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
